      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something simple like additional parameters with a collision tag suffix would suffice. For example, setting the parameter name to \"MyParam\" and collision tags like \"Head\", \"Hand\" and \"Pizza\" could produce additional parameters available for use in animators: MyParam_Head, MyParam_Hand and MyParam_Pizza.\n\nI'm sad this topic lies forgotten since 2022 without any upvotes. I'm considering creating a new ticket with a slightly different title and description just to give this idea a chance.",
